\#{ Jinja delimiters are remapped in render.py because the defaults collide with
    LaTeX. Interpolation, control flow and comments are the three backslash forms
    used throughout this file; every interpolated value is LaTeX-escaped
    automatically by latex.finalize, so nothing here needs an explicit filter.
    Note that a comment ends at its first closing brace -- do not write the
    delimiter names inside one. }
