\section*{Disclaimer}
This document is a work of satire produced automatically by \textsc{Rhetoric-AI}
from the prompt: ``\VAR{spec.claim}''. It is fiction formatted to resemble an
academic preprint. There was no study. The stated sample of
\VAR{spec.dataset.n} \VAR{spec.dataset.population} does not exist, the
